    "text": "Match List - I with List - II.<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-I (Salt)</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-II&nbsp;(Flame colour wavelength)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0217e565-ca29-4400-90db-6846af03ed46-image.png\" style=\"width: 158px; height: 46px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/08d4de91-2a2f-4c10-8e2b-200519a02c8b-image.png\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 44px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/10dcf030-7b0a-4369-bcd3-ee2434bc9ebb-image.png\" style=\"width: 168px; height: 50px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi>Hg</mi></mfenced><mo>/</mo><mi>Conc</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fa1d2e93-87f7-4d63-915a-fd4ebb2a7ff9-image.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 50px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>Red</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
